# The parent enclosure/.gitignore excludes *.stl and *.3mf as build output.
# This folder's print files ARE committed, as in the other case folders, so
# a fresh clone has them and `git clean -X` can't delete the only copies.
#
# They are still generated, not authored. If you change the .scad, re-export
# and commit both together, or the mesh silently stops matching the source.
!*.stl
# The collar's two-colour project and its lettering coupon (make-collar-3mf.py).
!collar_twotone.3mf
!test_lettering_*.3mf
